# The "with optionals" pass: all four mods this port has an optional patch for, together. None
# is mutually incompatible with another, so one combined pass covers all four rather than one
# pass per mod; each scenario that needs one is gated by its own @requires tag regardless.
# Ids read from each mod's own About.xml / Workshop page, 2026-09-28.
#
# Vanilla Expanded Framework is Alpha Biomes' own hard dependency (not this mod's, not staged by
# default), and it is missing here on purpose in the first version of this file: that omission
# stalled the first "avec facultatifs" run (98ce, 2026-09-28) on a TypeLoadException from a VEF
# type Alpha Biomes could not resolve, cascading into thousands of "BadTexture" material warnings
# until the watchdog gave up. The staging script copies only this mod's own direct dependencies,
# not a dependency's dependencies - see PickleTools/Authoring/README.md, "it is not a recursive
# dependency resolver". Listed before Alpha Biomes: prerequisites go before their consumers.
